## Ticket Registry (Harness)

<!-- PROCESS — keep as-is. -->
Every ticket's accumulated knowledge lives in `docs/tickets/<id>/`, with `CONTEXT.md` as the single entry point.

- **Locate:** read `docs/tickets/INDEX.md` — the auto-generated registry of every ticket.
- **Enter:** read only that directory's `CONTEXT.md` **frontmatter** (`title`, `description`) before opening any other file inside it.
- **Create/update:** every ticket `CONTEXT.md` carries frontmatter with at least `title` and `description`; optional `state`, `labels`, `repo`, `updated`.
- **Maintenance:**
  ```bash
  node docs/tickets/update-tickets-index.mjs           # regenerate INDEX.md
  node docs/tickets/update-tickets-index.mjs --check   # verify all tickets have valid frontmatter
  node docs/tickets/update-tickets-index.mjs --init    # scaffold CONTEXT.md for ticket dirs that lack it
  ```
- Ticket dirs live only under `docs/tickets/` — do not create ticket directories directly under `docs/`.

